     The user interface to ggddbb is via gdb(1) (_p_o_r_t_s_/_d_e_v_e_l_/_g_d_b), so gdb(1)
     (_p_o_r_t_s_/_d_e_v_e_l_/_g_d_b) commands also work.  This section discusses only the
     extensions for kernel debugging that get installed in the kernel build
     directory.

